 // RewindBox (patch 0059): what a frame's record hashes of a shader: the 16 characters of its key, the same from one frame, object and session to the next (0 = no shader).
 //   Patch 0064: as the number those characters spell when they are hexadecimal digits (a translated shader's key), so that a line can print it the way a capture's pass list
